{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-12T08:38:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2032013362012590196"],"id":"2032013362012590196","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":7819,"like_count":147,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":17},"text":"他每次都能把你从坏情绪中拯救出来 然后没过多久又让你陷入更坏的情绪中","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2032013362012590196"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-12T08:37:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2032013217929871462"],"id":"2032013217929871462","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":40019,"like_count":462,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":62},"text":"断掉的是聊天日期吗 好像是我们的感情吧","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2032013217929871462"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-12T03:44:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031939274460053953"],"id":"2031939274460053953","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2180,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"对于我这种人来说，别人眼中的吃顿好的，可能会在一定程度上造成我的破产","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031939274460053953"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-11T18:33:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031800619225538670"],"id":"2031800619225538670","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":15059,"like_count":273,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":44},"text":"如果迟到的醒悟和道歉都太晚了，就让离别教会我们懂得珍惜和悔改吧，误会也不必解开了，我们都真的努力过了，不合适的人总要面对现实，回归正轨。我尝试与你沟通 ，但是就像拳头打在棉花上 ，你永远不会与我共情，我不该改变你，我该放弃你。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031800619225538670"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-11T18:26:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031798894364148168"],"id":"2031798894364148168","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":9309,"like_count":162,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":17},"text":"我是绝对不会求你摸摸我的头的，喜欢被摸脑袋什么的也太像小狗了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031798894364148168"},{"author_id":"