62910845","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5720,"like_count":77,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"感觉被喜欢真的是一件很幸福的事情，好希望被更多人喜欢...","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031424822362910845"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T17:15:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031418676898062612"],"id":"2031418676898062612","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":12891,"like_count":220,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":19},"text":"你总说我会遇见更好的人 其实是你想遇见更好的人","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031418676898062612"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T15:52:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031397830598996343"],"id":"2031397830598996343","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3188,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我有恋狗癖","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031397830598996343"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T13:56:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031368706262184049"],"id":"2031368706262184049","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1858,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"kiri饿的要消失飘散不见了…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031368706262184049"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T12:44:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031350531277598965"],"id":"2031350531277598965","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":8704,"like_count":173,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":16},"text":"人和人的羁绊太深是会掉眼泪的","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031350531277598965"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T12:41:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031349674054189272"],"id":"2031349674054189272","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4668,"like_count":87,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":11},"text":"但其实一直都是我在当创可贴，所以撕下来后我被丢掉了，而你只留下了一点可以轻易去除掉的胶痕。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031349674054189272"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T12:41:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031349639870554198"],"id":"2031349639870554198","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5426,"like_count":77,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":14},"text":"离别的时候你也会和我一样难过吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031349639870554198"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T11:06:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031325707553694033"],"id":"2031325707553694033","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":58,"impression_count":115337,"like_count":1889,"quote_count":48,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":202},"text":"梦想是急头白脸表现一顿然后被年上抱在怀里摸着头夸好孩子。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031325707553694033"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T11:01:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031324486642053424"],"id":"2031324486642053424","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2481,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"为了防止我暴饮暴食所以我把我能吃的都吃了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031324486642053424"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T10:56:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031323201637331068"],"id":"2031323201637331068","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6103,"like_count":103,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":19},"text":"我现在的心情在喝百草枯还是喝敌敌畏中徘徊。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031323201637331068"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T09:03:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031294990002029022"],"id":"2031294990002029022","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1866,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实我一直很喜欢我前夫的文字。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031294990002029022"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T09:00:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031294017959547021"],"id":"2031294017959547021","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":4420,"like_count":121,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":12},"text":"在我幸福的时候，我就感觉你之前没那么爱我；在我痛苦的时候，我就会想起你之前好像很爱我。可在那段我俩相恋的日子里，你对我的做过的事从没变过，究竟是为什么呢？好奇怪。不过幸好，我现在一直痛苦，你也一直爱我。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031294017959547021"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T01:51:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031186188204388536"],"id":"2031186188204388536","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1726,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我在贫穷的挨骂和富裕的挨骂之间选择了富裕的挨骂","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031186188204388536"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T01:11:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031176066073833594"],"id":"2031176066073833594","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":7207,"like_count":154,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":25},"text":"好想和一个人在一起好久好久 久到我可以不加掩饰的大笑 久到一起聊个通宵 再一起去吃凌晨五点的早餐久到有一条长长的围巾将彼此包裹 在大雪中一起淋到白头","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031176066073833594"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-10T01:07:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2031175173018472627"],"id":"2031175173018472627","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":111,"impression_count":117954,"like_count":2143,"quote_count":45,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":238},"text":"一个破坏你精神健康的人 不可能成为你的一生挚爱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2031175173018472627"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2032013362012590196","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juehh7954908owr84g714eblhhq2yl","oldest_id":"2031175173018472627","result_count":25}}